## 🌿 Sustainability Assessment & Calculation Methodology (Module 1 Scope)

In direct response to feedback from Carolina and Teacher Team B, the sustainability assessment is embedded directly into the live **sub-500ms decision-support process** rather than treated merely as a passive post-hoc benefit. 

As each freight unit passes through the 3-Gate shadow engine, the system calculates real-time operational and environmental metrics. This enables border control authorities and fleet dispatchers to make **sustainability-informed routing and clearance decisions**.

---

