### 🎯 Sustainability Assessment inside the Decision-Support Process

Rather than treating these metrics as retrospective figures, the Digital Twin uses them directly within the border control workflow:

1. **Pre-Clearance Routing Priority:** High-compliance cold-chain vehicles (carrying perishable food/pharma) are flagged with live *High Thermal Vulnerability* scores, prioritizing them for automated express gates to maximize prevented diesel burn and avoid cargo decay.
2. **Real-Time Threshold Alerts:** Border control officers receive live warnings on their WebGL SCADA interface when staging queues exceed environmental safety thresholds (e.g., high localized $\text{PM}_{2.5}$ or $\text{NO}_x$ build-up), triggering automated fast-lane clearance protocols.
3. **Audit-Ready Scope 3 Reporting:** As each truck passes, the system issues an anonymized, certified ESG transaction record validating the exact $\text{CO}_2$ and fuel savings, supporting regulatory compliance (CSDDD/CSRD) for freight operators and public authorities alike.

